<title>ESTONIA: ESTONIA - UNEMPLOYMENT SLIGHTLY DOWN IN MAY.</title>
<headline>ESTONIA - UNEMPLOYMENT SLIGHTLY DOWN IN MAY.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The registered number of unemployed seeking work through the state labour exchange fell slightly in May compared to April, it said on Friday.</p>
</text>
